## AutoWork runtime state — never commit these.
## Config is safe by design (it holds only secret *references*), but the secret store,
## knowledge bases, action logs and screenshots are personal data.
secrets.json
secrets.json.key
config.json.broken-*
logs/
knowledge/
screenshots/
recycle/
workspace/

## Live-test credentials kept in the working tree. These are real keys; the live suite reads
## them via AUTOWORK_LIVE_* rather than the repo, so nothing here needs to be committed.
testkey*.txt
tavilykey.txt
*.key.txt
